## Key Concepts
- S3 event triggers and Lambda orchestration
- AWS Glue Data Catalog and crawlers for schema inference
- Lightweight ETL transformations in Lambda (normalization, data validation)
- DynamoDB indexing with upsert operations for idempotency
- IAM roles with least-privilege access
- Encryption at rest (SSE-KMS) and in transit (TLS)
